{"id":"658268","name":"野生小葱炒鸡蛋","author":"宛馨儿爱美食","authorId":"11545388","desc":"","cover":"images/658268/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"野生小葱","amount":"1把"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"野生小葱。","img":"images/658268/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用锄头连根挖出来的野生小葱。","img":"images/658268/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"清洗干净。","img":"images/658268/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切小段。","img":"images/658268/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/658268/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅里放油。","img":"images/658268/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放进锅里炒几下。","img":"images/658268/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒入一点盐，继续翻炒几下。","img":"images/658268/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"炒至便软，倒入蛋液，蛋液凝固，再加入适量盐，翻炒。","img":"images/658268/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"一盘没化肥、没农药的野生小葱炒鸡蛋就美味上桌了。","img":"images/658268/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}